== Introduction ==

Documentation for [[Addon|addons]] is maintained in several places: this wiki, project READMEs, repository wikis, and separate manuals. This directory links to those starting points. For available addons and installation, use the [https://www.freecad.org/addons.php addon catalog] and [[Std_AddonMgr|Addon Manager]].

The directory covers the [https://github.com/FreeCAD/Addons/blob/8db8f56929fe98f34a32d53566594b926a6d34ff/Data/Index.json registered addon index] checked in September 2026. Names follow the index, including preference packs and libraries. Macros distributed separately through [[Macros_recipes|Macros recipes]] are documented on their individual wiki pages.

== Finding the right documentation ==

Start with the documentation or FreeCAD wiki link. A README may contain the instructions itself or link to a more detailed manual. Use the project repository to find release-specific documentation when an addon offers several versions. Check the addon's requirements before installation; inclusion in this directory does not establish compatibility with every FreeCAD version.

